    {
      "subId": "2300910",
      "subQuestName": "Bring the sample back to Akim",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230091001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230091001": {
            "id": "230091001",
            "speakerId": 4016,
            "speakerName": "Akim",
            "text": "Did you get the soil?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2300919",
      "subQuestName": "Keep talking to Akim",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230091901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230091901": {
            "id": "230091901",
            "speakerId": 4016,
            "speakerName": "Akim",
            "text": "Thank you, these should last me for a while.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230091902"
            ]
          },
          "230091902": {
            "id": "230091902",
            "speakerId": 4016,
            "speakerName": "Akim",
            "text": "I'm thinking that there might be other ways to improve the Concresoil...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230091903"
            ]
          },
          "230091903": {
            "id": "230091903",
            "speakerId": 4016,
            "speakerName": "Akim",
            "text": "For example, perhaps the soil can also be highly water-retentive and nutrient-rich...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230091904"
            ]
          },
          "230091904": {
            "id": "230091904",
            "speakerId": 4016,
            "speakerName": "Akim",
            "text": "*sigh* I'm just not smart enough. If it was those wise folks, they would have definitely come up with more good ideas..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2300911",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Akim",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230091101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230091101": {
            "id": "230091101",
            "speakerId": 4016,
            "speakerName": "Akim",
            "text": "Traveler! Thank goodness you're here. I was just in need of someone's help!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230091102"
            ]
          },
          "230091102": {
            "id": "230091102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So you've made progress in your soil research?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230091103"
            ]
          },
          "230091103": {
            "id": "230091103",
            "speakerId": 4016,
            "speakerName": "Akim",
            "text": "Well... I don't think I could call it \"progress,\" but a customer of mine did give me some useful advice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230091104"
            ]
          },
          "230091104": {
            "id": "230091104",
            "speakerId": 4016,
            "speakerName": "Akim",
            "text": "He said that he enjoys growing flowers and the thing that troubles him most is finding the right soil.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230091114"
            ]
          },
          "230091114": {
            "id": "230091114",
            "speakerId": 4016,
            "speakerName": "Akim",
            "text": "The soil needs to have good permeability and adequate nutrients. Plus, it should be water retentive but not soggy...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230091105"
            ]
          },
          "230091105": {
            "id": "230091105",
            "speakerId": 4016,
            "speakerName": "Akim",
            "text": "Knowing that I've made such improvements to the Concresoil, he asked me if I could devise a version of it for flowers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230091106"
            ]
          },
          "230091106": {
            "id": "230091106",
            "speakerId": 4016,
            "speakerName": "Akim",
            "text": "I found it worth researching, so I'm looking for other materials to further upgrade my Concresoil.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230091107"
            ]
          },
          "230091107": {
            "id": "230091107",
            "speakerId": 4016,
            "speakerName": "Akim",
            "text": "Could you please help me look for some fertile soil this time?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230091108"
            ]
          },
          "230091108": {
            "id": "230091108",
            "speakerId": 4016,
            "speakerName": "Akim",
            "text": "I'll mark the location of the soil on the map for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230091111"
            ]
          },
          "230091111": {
            "id": "230091111",
            "speakerId": 4016,
            "speakerName": "Akim",
            "text": "I asked around, of course. It's a little out of the way, but they say the soil there is very fertile.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230091112"
            ]
          },
          "230091112": {
            "id": "230091112",
            "speakerId": 4016,
            "speakerName": "Akim",
            "text": "But there seems to be a lot of monsters over there too, so I wouldn't dare to go myself...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230091113"
            ]
          },
          "230091113": {
            "id": "230091113",
            "speakerId": 4016,
            "speakerName": "Akim",
            "text": "I'm counting on you, Traveler!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
